      "review_title": "AMAZING GAME! BIG FAN!",
      "review_description": "Hello,\nI been playing pixel dungeon every day since I can remember. Im planning on playing this game just as much. I wish there was normal movement as a lot of people would also want to use that as well. Especially people above the age of 18, especially ones with jobs. Anyways keep up the good work. Love the game!\n\nThe anime character I would want to see is Rimuru, from that time I got reincarnated as a slime, aka Tensura. One of the most popular isekei genre Anime and popular selling manga out there. Having this character would be amazing. Also he can turn to a slime and vise versa, that would be kinda funny to have a slime transformation. Haha. Obviously not needed but having Rimuru as a character would be amazing. Also Rimuru has a sword too :)  Adding his sword to the list of anime swords i saw would be cool. Anyways 5 out of 5 stars. 100000 stars for when Rimuru joins : )",
