      "id": "1092033886694050",
      "score": 5,
      "review_title": "this game is seriously awesome!",
      "review_description": "The open worldadd an aspect of adventure that a lot of vr games are missing. The is game very balanced, so it doesn't take hours to make progress and as i was testing the game, you can really see how much care they put into it.  The surplus of weapons give you a sense of freedom. Different things you can do in the game are upgrading your weapons and transforming into your favorite anime character, puffy! the game is still being expanded on, so ill be looking forward to what they add next. I personally hope they add Ichigo's hollow transformation. Also, this isn't a bot review, I'm just voicing my thoughts on the game.",
